{"number":101,"name":"سُورَةُ القَارِعَةِ","englishName":"Al-Qaari'a","englishNameTranslation":"The Calamity","revelationType":"Meccan","numberOfAyahs":11,"ayahs":[{"number":6158,"numberInSurah":1,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6158.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6158.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"الساعة التي تقرع قلوب الناس بأهوالها.","translationEn":"The Striking Calamity -","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6159,"numberInSurah":2,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6159.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6159.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"أيُّ شيء هذه القارعة؟","translationEn":"What is the Striking Calamity?","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6160,"numberInSurah":3,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6160.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6160.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"وأيُّ شيء أعلمك بها؟","translationEn":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6161,"numberInSurah":4,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6161.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6161.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"في ذلك اليوم يكون الناس في كثرتهم وتفرقهم وحركتهم كالفراش المنتشر، وهو الذي يتساقط في النار.","translationEn":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6162,"numberInSurah":5,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6162.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6162.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"وتكون الجبال كالصوف متعدد الألوان الذي يُنْفَش باليد، فيصير هباء ويزول.","translationEn":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6163,"numberInSurah":6,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6163.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6163.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"فأما من رجحت موازين حسناته، فهو في حياة مرضية في الجنة.","translationEn":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6164,"numberInSurah":7,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6164.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6164.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"فأما من رجحت موازين حسناته، فهو في حياة مرضية في الجنة.","translationEn":"He will be in a pleasant life.","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6165,"numberInSurah":8,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6165.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6165.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"وأما من خفت موازين حسناته، ورجحت موازين سيئاته، فمأواه جهنم.","translationEn":"But as for one whose scales are light,","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6166,"numberInSurah":9,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌۭ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6166.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6166.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"وأما من خفت موازين حسناته، ورجحت موازين سيئاته، فمأواه جهنم.","translationEn":"His refuge will be an abyss.","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6167,"numberInSurah":10,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6167.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6167.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"وما أدراك -أيها الرسول- ما هذه الهاوية؟","translationEn":"And what can make you know what that is?","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6168,"numberInSurah":11,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6168.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6168.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"إنها نار قد حَمِيت من الوقود عليها.","translationEn":"It is a Fire, intensely hot.","transliterationEn":""}]}